data: {"delta":"Spain won the 2026 FIFA World Cup final by defeating Argentina 1-0 after extra time. The match took place on Sunday, July 19, 2026, at New York New Jersey Stadium in front of a crowd of over 80,000 spectators. Spanish forward Ferran Torres scored the winning goal in extra time and was named the Man of the Match [2, 6].","conversationId":"cmw01h9dw0014qarei521ygfi"}

